    "title": "Three-bedroom house sells in Danielsville for $330,000 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Real Estate Newswire ,\n8 hours ago A single-family house, built in 1968, has changed hands. The home at 2856 West Scenic Drive in Danielsville was sold on Feb. 2. The purchase price was $330,000. This single-story house has three bedrooms and one bathroom. Inside, there is a fireplace. The property is equipped with forced air heating. Additionally, the building has access to a detached garage for three cars. The property sits on a 1.2-acre lot. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
